{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833570/extras/0642f1547d494f352c78bdb020035905.poster.avif?t=1768592110\" width=606 height=38 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833570/extras/0642f1547d494f352c78bdb020035905.webm?t=1768592110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833570/extras/0642f1547d494f352c78bdb020035905.mp4?t=1768592110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Vampire Syndicate: Gangs of MoonFall</i> is an old-school RPG set amidst the vampire-dominated gangs of a cyberpunk city. As a Familiar of one of the ancient vampire lineages, you have been tasked by your undead masters to expand their criminal empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>A story of lust and blood</u></i></strong>\u00a0- The vampires of MoonFall are different from the ones you may be used to. While all vampires are undead and must drink blood, how vampirism is spread, and the array of powers a new vampire gains, will vary depending on the lineage. Each lineage is, in effect, a different \u201cspecies\u201d of vampire and the lineage that the player chooses will alter story events, making each playthrough with a specific lineage have its own unique quirks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833570/extras/ed8f129c81d3315968530e1a5587b35c.avif?t=1768592110\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Crime Pays</u></i></strong>\u00a0- Conduct criminal activities for your vampire lineage. You are offered freedom in how you go about this, and can take on missions or contracts as they wish. Missions (such as heists or raids) take place on the overworld map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can encounter a variety of different groups, such as corporate convoys, mercenaries, street-level gangers, rival familiars, etc. Or visit new locations and faction headquarters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters can be benign, or they can result in violence. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Go and make a name for yourself as a hired thug, assassin, master thief, or even skilled lover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833570/extras/ed0fbc1371f90cfd9350339687a3fbce.avif?t=1768592110\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-School cRPG:</strong> Featuring turn-based combat, character creation, classes, skill checks, etc!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erotic Entertainment:</strong>\u00a0Vampires are sexual creatures, expect opportunities for casual sex or  long-term romances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice and Consequence:</strong> Faction reputations, NPC loyalties, dynamic world states, multiple story routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Crew:</strong> Recruit cutthroats, thieves, hackers, flamboyantly-dressed thugs and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Anime Style:</strong> Making a return from <i>Memory of a Battle Brothel</i>, anime-styled body sprites can be used in dialogue.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1833570?t=1768592110","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768592110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s